{"games":[{"id":17298259950,"name":"COMMAND MADNESS [THE BANANA UPDATE]","desc":"💥 WELCOME TO COMMAND MADNESS! 💥\n\n-Will you rule the server, or hide to survive?\n\n👑 BECOME THE ADMIN: Hunt down the Survivors to earn Abuse Points. Spend your Abuse Points to unlock insane, overpowered Admin Commands and control the game!\n\n🏃 BECOME A SURVIVOR: Run, hide, and outsmart the Admin to earn Survivor Points. Unlock powerful items that help you escape, hide, and fight back!\n\n👾 SPECIAL GAME MODES: Partake in Random Special Game Modes to earn massive amounts of Points!\n\n⭐ VIP Server Notice:\nYou can't earn Points or Wins in VIP Servers the normal way. Instead, all players automatically receive +800 Abuse Points and +400 Survivor Points every 8 minutes!\n\n👍 Like and Favorite for more updates! ⭐","path":"/game/17298259950-command-madness","slug":"17298259950-command-madness","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9937f644d3f9e557c1ca2edb4ed6892b4a4cbc9a9a251d2887694e03d5128d72.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-928c06ddc1b568872be0fc0502b2be71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":3018721,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-03T08:33:13.019Z","creator":{"name":"OyunKlavuzu","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":103727612616060,"name":"🇦🇺Better Country?!🇺🇸","desc":"Silly little game i made for fun, don't take it too seriously. - I am unsure what to add next, please feel free to suggest things in feedback.\n\n🇧🇷🇺🇸🇨🇦 Welcome to Better Country! 🇦🇺🇰🇷🇨🇳\n\n⭐👍 LIKE and FAVORITE the game for new updates! 👍⭐\n\n🎮🌎 Game Rules\n⭐️🌍Choose 1 Country that has been selected!\n🗡️🌏Fight for your country choice with weapons!\n🏆🌐Successfully defend your country choice and bring the country a win for your team!\n\n⚠️ Better country is not intended to be political or represent real life conflicts in any way, it is intended to be a geography game. ⚠️\n\nInspired by better music, better movie and better kpop!\n\nTags 🏷️ \n--\nAustralia, Russia, France, Spain, United States, America, Italy, Turkey, Mexico, United Kingdom, Germany, Japan, Indonesia, Greece, New Zealand, Israel, Korea, Iran, Iraq, Mexico\n--","path":"/game/103727612616060-better-country","slug":"103727612616060-better-country","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2c341d6cdeacecae7546a1dddd18fa70a5d48b3d28d3cf9e3aa3236809338386.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-83437aa2b1b4619ebe10cb5f9c6fe7c9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":9048520,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-12-23T06:31:41.715Z","creator":{"name":"MajorGalah","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13043572487,"name":"Super Football","desc":"Soccer unites the world.\nPlay with friends in a casual 5v5 match. Reach the game's limits and score the best bicycle kicks or save the fastest shot. It's all on you.\n\nAdvanced Controls:\n- Bicycle Kick (Shoot + Jump)\n- Flick (Pass + Jump)\nKeybinds / Buttons can be edited in settings","path":"/game/13043572487-super-football","slug":"13043572487-super-football","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a379ae0d5d273c601cd30d97c1de7bf61feab629e7f550acac4c1ae881ea014f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ca5b4130236450c01806ed3461f72dcb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":79898985,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-12-25T00:55:55.137Z","creator":{"name":"jcs1p","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15129345332,"name":"[HALLOWEEN] Horticulture: The Lawn [Beta]","desc":"WARNING: This game has a lot of flashing visual effects, seizure warning.\n---------------------\nPlay during the weekend will boost the coin earned from progressing waves by 2x\n---------------------\nHorticulture: The Lawn, a game in The Lawn universe. Some incidents took place hundreds of years ago that caused an infection outbreak. Even after several successful cures, the death still